ments are accepted at Regulations.gov through Dec. 18 under docket FMCSA-2026-3707.</description></item><item><title>Workhorse expands Canadian dealer network with Ontario’s BDS Fleet Service</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/workhorse-expands-canadian-dealer-network-with-ontario-s-bds-fleet-ser-e312a26da7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/workhorse-expands-canadian-dealer-network-with-ontario-s-bds-fleet-ser-e312a26da7/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:14:33 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>Truck News</description></item><item><title>J.B. Hunt sees cost pressures ease, touts dedicated wins</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/j-b-hunt-sees-cost-pressures-ease-touts-dedicated-wins-f87d6a1439/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/j-b-hunt-sees-cost-pressures-ease-touts-dedicated-wins-f87d6a1439/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:27:51 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>FreightWaves</description></item><item><title>Canadian freight volumes climb as US spot rates remain elevated</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/canadian-freight-volumes-climb-as-us-spot-rates-remain-elevated-9d10911ef3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/canadian-freight-volumes-climb-as-us-spot-rates-remain-elevated-9d10911ef3/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:20:44 +0000</pubDate><category>Rates &amp; Market</category><description>Truck News</description></item><item><title>The Lag Effect: Trucking Capacity Declines as Rates Recover</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/the-lag-effect-trucking-capacity-declines-as-rates-recover-da3b07d0c8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/the-lag-effect-trucking-capacity-declines-as-rates-recover-da3b07d0c8/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:04:00 +0000</pubDate><category>Rates &amp; Market</category><description>FreightWaves</description></item><item><title>Trucking companies used in $7.2-million 